---
import MiniLayout from '../../../layouts/MiniLayout.astro';
---

<MiniLayout title="Creator Hub // neøflow Minis" role="creator" activeTab="home">
  <div class="creator-hub-view">
    <div class="hub-kicker font-mono">NΞØ GATEKEEPER // CREATOR NETWORK</div>

    <div class="hub-hero">
      <h1 class="font-display">Monetize sua audiência com produtos validados.</h1>
      <p class="hub-lead">
        Chega de comissão incerta. Escolha produtos com alta taxa de conversão, split automático no app e links automáticos de DM.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Creator Metrics Snapshot -->
    <div class="creator-summary-card">
      <div class="sum-row">
        <span class="sum-label font-mono">SEU STATUS NO GATEKEEPER</span>
        <span class="sum-badge font-mono">VERIFICADO TIER 1</span>
      </div>
      <div class="sum-val font-display">R$ 3.840,00</div>
      <span class="sum-sub font-mono">Disponível para saque no TikTok</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Navigation Cards -->
    <div class="quick-nav-grid">
      <a href="/minis/creator/catalog" class="nav-card">
        <div class="nav-icon">📦</div>
        <div class="nav-text">
          <strong>Explorar Catálogo</strong>
          <span>Produtos com comissão de até 35%</span>
        </div>
        <span class="nav-arrow font-mono">→</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/minis/creator/wallet" class="nav-card">
        <div class="nav-icon">💳</div>
        <div class="nav-text">
          <strong>Extrato &amp; Split</strong>
          <span>Vendas por DM e lives em tempo real</span>
        </div>
        <span class="nav-arrow font-mono">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- DM Automation Tool Box -->
    <div class="dm-box">
      <div class="dm-header">
        <span class="font-mono" style="color: var(--neo-cyan); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700;">AUTOMAÇÃO DE DM ATIVA</span>
        <span class="dm-dot"></span>
      </div>
      <p class="dm-text">
        Quando alguém comentar <strong>"QUERO"</strong> nos seus vídeos, seu link seguro de checkout nativo é enviado na DM em <strong>120ms</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</MiniLayout>

<style>
  .creator-hub-view {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .hub-kicker {
    color: var(--neo-cyan);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .hub-hero h1 {
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .hub-lead {
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .creator-summary-card {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12) 0%, rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.9) 70%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .sum-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .sum-label {
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
  }

  .sum-badge {
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    color: var(--neo-cyan);
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .sum-val {
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .sum-sub {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: #4ade80;
  }

  .quick-nav-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .nav-card {
    background: rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.75);
    border: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .nav-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--neo-cyan);
  }

  .nav-icon {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .nav-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .nav-text strong {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .nav-text span {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
  }

  .nav-arrow {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .dm-box {
    background: rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.6);
    border: 1px dashed rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.35);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .dm-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .dm-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--neo-cyan);
    box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--neo-cyan);
  }

  .dm-text {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .dm-text strong {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
</style>
